OL,3,GNEWSA'I was weeks from marrying a
OL,4,Aviolent serial rapist - my loved ones
OL,5,Asaved my life'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis article contains details,
OL,8,Fincluding depictions of violence, which
OL,9,Fsome readers may find distressing.
OL,11,FWithout the interventions of her family
OL,12,Fand friends, Amy says she would have
OL,13,Fmarried the man who had physically and
OL,14,Fpsychologically abused her for much of
OL,15,Ftheir relationship.
OL,17,FHad the wedding gone ahead, she fears
OL,18,Fhe would have eventually killed her.
