OL,3,GNEWSA'I was weeks from marrying a
OL,4,Aviolent serial rapist - my loved ones
OL,5,Asaved my life'
OL,6,
OL,7,FChristopher Malcolm, a serial rapist
OL,8,Fwho was recently jailed for his crimes,
OL,9,Finflicted life-changing injuries on his
OL,10,Fformer fiancee - on one occasion she
OL,11,Fsaid he left her face "black and blue"
OL,12,Fjust before she visited her terminally
OL,13,Fill father for Father's Day.
